</section>


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
     §9 FINAL CTA
═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<CTASection
  heading="Book Your Herbal Consultation"
  sub="Same-week appointments available at both our Reading and Wimbledon clinics. Cantonese & English consultations available. No referral needed."
/>

</Base>
